{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-explainer-about-michael-jordan-dennis-rodman-and-dirk-nowitzki-center-michael-jordan-th/audio/main-5805aad9ba2b.mp3","durationSec":220.056,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":2.82,"text":"Michael Jordan was a famous American basketball player."},{"start":3.6,"end":5.24,"text":"His main team was the Chicago Bulls."},{"start":5.92,"end":10.52,"text":"They played in the NBA, the National Basketball Association, a big basketball league."},{"start":11.14,"end":14.74,"text":"The Bulls chose Jordan as the third player in the 1984 draft."},{"start":15.46,"end":17.56,"text":"A draft is how teams choose new players."},{"start":18.6,"end":21.9,"text":"Jordan became Rookie of the Year, an award for the best new player."},{"start":22.8,"end":26.24,"text":"People also called him Air Jordan because of his high-leaping dunks."},{"start":26.8,"end":29.64,"text":"A dunk means putting the ball down through the basket from above."},{"start":30.8,"end":33.12,"text":"His jumps made that nickname easy to understand."},{"start":34.24,"end":36.92,"text":"Jordan was very good at scoring, which means getting points."},{"start":37.58,"end":39.04,"text":"He won ten scoring titles."},{"start":39.62,"end":43.52,"text":"A scoring title goes to the player with the highest average points per game in a season."},{"start":44.26,"end":50.72,"text":"When he retired, his career average was 30.1 points per game, the highest in NBA history at that time."},{"start":51.02,"end":52.64,"text":"But scoring was not his only skill."},{"start":53.12,"end":54.59,"text":"He also played strong defense."},{"start":54.58,"end":58.76,"text":"Defense means trying to stop the other team from scoring."},{"start":58.76,"end":61.6,"text":"Jordan won Defensive Player of the Year once."},{"start":62.42,"end":65.9,"text":"He could get points for his team and make scoring harder for the other team."},{"start":67.02,"end":68.74,"text":"Jordan had a very strong desire to win."},{"start":69.3,"end":73.72,"text":"He was known for being competitive: he wanted to beat the other team and be the best."},{"start":74.68,"end":77.04,"text":"His story was not only about exciting dunks."},{"start":77.56,"end":79.9,"text":"It was also about winning with the Chicago Bulls."},{"start":80.76,"end":92.18,"text":"The Bulls won six NBA championships with Jordan: in 1991, 1992, 1993, 1996, 1997, and 1998."},{"start":93.12,"end":97.76,"text":"He was Finals MVP each time, the best player in the championship series."},{"start":98.66,"end":100.92,"text":"He also won five season MVP awards."},{"start":101.44,"end":103.7,"text":"MVP means Most Valuable Player."},{"start":104.12,"end":108,"text":"These awards help explain why people remember Jordan as such a great player."},{"start":109,"end":111.34,"text":"Dennis Rodman was another kind of basketball star."},{"start":111.84,"end":113.42,"text":"He was not known as a big scorer."},{"start":114.18,"end":116.44,"text":"His main jobs were rebounding and defense."},{"start":117.24,"end":120.5,"text":"A rebound means getting the ball after a shot misses the basket."},{"start":121.28,"end":124.84,"text":"This can give your team another chance to score or stop the other team’s attack."},{"start":125.84,"end":132.12,"text":"Rodman led the NBA in rebounds per game for seven seasons in a row, from 1992 to 1998."},{"start":132.94,"end":135.26,"text":"He also won Defensive Player of the Year twice."},{"start":136.18,"end":142.64,"text":"He played alongside Jordan when the Chicago Bulls won three championships from 1996 to 1998."},{"start":143.54,"end":145.4,"text":"His different skills helped the team win."},{"start":146.56,"end":149.04,"text":"Dirk Nowitzki came from Germany, in Europe."},{"start":149.84,"end":152.8,"text":"He was a tall forward, about 2.13 metres tall."},{"start":153.48,"end":155.58,"text":"A forward is a player position in basketball."},{"start":156.26,"end":159.6,"text":"Nowitzki was famous for shooting from outside, farther from the basket."},{"start":160.3,"end":163.18,"text":"His special shot was the one-legged fadeaway."},{"start":163.18,"end":166.58,"text":"He shot while standing on one leg and moving away from the defender."},{"start":167.24,"end":168.92,"text":"This made the shot harder to stop."},{"start":169.54,"end":172.68,"text":"He played all 21 of his NBA seasons with the Dallas Mavericks."},{"start":173.28,"end":176.16,"text":"He won the season MVP award in 2007."},{"start":177.2,"end":182.22,"text":"In 2011, he led Dallas to the NBA championship and won Finals MVP."},{"start":183.42,"end":187.58,"text":"These three players show that basketball stars do not all play the same way."},{"start":188.52,"end":191.32,"text":"Jordan was a great scorer who also played strong defense."},{"start":192.02,"end":198.3,"text":"His high dunks earned him the name Air Jordan, and his six championships with the Bulls were a big part of his success."},{"start":199.3,"end":200.8,"text":"Rodman’s main work was different."},{"start":201.3,"end":204.06,"text":"He got rebounds and stopped other players from scoring."},{"start":204.64,"end":211.3,"text":"Nowitzki showed another style: a tall European forward with an outside shot and a special fadeaway."},{"start":211.3,"end":213.82,"text":"When you watch basketball, look beyond the points."},{"start":214.58,"end":219.48,"text":"Notice who gets the ball back, who defends, and how each player shoots."}],"words":[{"text":"Michael","start":0,"end":0.36},{"text":"Jordan","start":0.36,"end":0.64},{"text":"was","start":0.64,"end":0.92},{"text":"a","start":0.92,"end":1.14},{"text":"famous","start":1.14,"end":1.42},{"text":"American","start":1.42,"end":1.98},{"text":"basketball","start":1.98,"end":2.4},{"text":"player","start":2.4,"end":2.82},{"text":"His","start":3.6,"end":3.72},{"text":"main","start":3.72,"end":3.94},{"text":"team","start":3.94,"end":4.24},{"text":"was","start":4.24,"end":4.42},{"text":"the","start":4